# source: spec
# spec: docs/protocol/compression-lzh.md#end-of-stream
# provenance: PV-0060, PV-0061, PV-0062, PV-0063, PV-0064, PV-0066, PV-0067, PV-0068, PV-0350, PV-0351, PV-0352, PV-0354, PV-0355, PV-0363, PV-0365, PV-0374
# kind: decompress
# description: The data ends before the final end-of-block code is complete.
# derivation: Header: length 1. Data = lzh-fixed-literal-no-noise without its last byte: the end of block occupies bits 13-19, and bits 16-19 are missing, so decoding fails with data-truncated (PV-0374, IMPL-LZH-1).
# expect.error: data-truncated
# expect.algorithm: lzh
# expect.uncompressed_length: 1
hex:
01 00 00 00                                       # uncompressed length, u32 LE
12                                                # algorithm byte
1F 9D                                             # magic
02                                                # byte 7
CC 11                                             # first two bytes of lzh-fixed-literal-no-noise
